-## CRITICAL FINDINGS
-
-### C1: `get-shared-plan` Edge Function Uses Service Role Key Without Authentication
-**Severity:** CRITICAL  
-**File:** `supabase/functions/get-shared-plan/index.ts` (lines 34-37)  
-**Evidence:**
-```typescript
-const supabaseAdmin = createClient(
-  Deno.env.get("SUPABASE_URL") ?? "",
-  Deno.env.get("SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY") ?? "",
-);
-```
-No authentication check exists. Any request with a valid versionId bypasses RLS entirely via service_role key.
-
-**Risk:** Anyone who discovers a versionId UUID can access locked plan data (meal plans, client names, macros). While UUIDs are hard to guess, they are not secrets.
-
-**Recommended Fix:** Add authentication verification (JWT check) and verify the caller owns the plan or is the linked client. Alternatively, use the anon key with a dedicated RLS policy.
